        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Table 18-38. SD_STAT Register Field Descriptions (continued)</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script defer src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html,\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #111;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 1530px;\n    height: 1980px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fff;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .brand {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 31px;\n    left: 139px;\n    width: 255px;\n    height: 61px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    color: #231f20;\n  }\n\n  .brand-mark {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 52px;\n    height: 53px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    color: #fff;\n    background: #231f20;\n    clip-path: polygon(\n      26% 0%, 74% 0%, 74% 21%, 93% 21%, 84% 47%,\n      75% 47%, 75% 73%, 62% 92%, 42% 92%, 31% 75%,\n      14% 75%, 2% 54%, 27% 54%\n    );\n  }\n\n  .brand-mark .ti {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 6px;\n    left: 18px;\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-style: italic;\n    letter-spacing: -5px;\n  }\n\n  .brand-name {\n    padding-top: 4px;\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-size: 29px;\n    line-height: 24px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-variant: small-caps;\n  }\n\n  .running-header {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 144px;\n    left: 135px;\n    width: 1260px;\n    height: 31px;\n    border-bottom: 4px solid #111;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    line-height: 26px;\n  }\n\n  .running-header .site {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    bottom: 5px;\n  }\n\n  .running-header .section-name {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    bottom: 5px;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n\n  .document-content {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 201px;\n    left: 135px;\n    width: 1260px;\n  }\n\n  .table-title {\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    line-height: 31px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  table.register-table {\n    width: 1260px;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    line-height: 22.5px;\n  }\n\n  .register-table col.bit {\n    width: 125px;\n  }\n\n  .register-table col.field {\n    width: 253px;\n  }\n\n  .register-table col.type {\n    width: 125px;\n  }\n\n  .register-table col.reset {\n    width: 126px;\n  }\n\n  .register-table col.description {\n    width: 631px;\n  }\n\n  .register-table th,\n  .register-table td {\n    border: 1px solid #111;\n  }\n\n  .register-table thead th {\n    height: 34px;\n    padding: 3px 8px 2px;\n    background: #d3d3d3;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    text-align: left;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    line-height: 24px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  .register-table thead th:first-child {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .register-table tbody td {\n    padding: 3px 8px;\n    vertical-align: top;\n    font-weight: normal;\n  }\n\n  .register-table td.bit-number {\n    padding-top: 3px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .register-table tr.row-cirq {\n    height: 449px;\n  }\n\n  .register-table tr.row-crem {\n    height: 234px;\n  }\n\n  .register-table tr.row-cins {\n    height: 235px;\n  }\n\n  .register-table tr.row-brr {\n    height: 370px;\n  }\n\n  .description-cell {\n    white-space: normal;\n  }\n\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 135px;\n    bottom: 42px;\n    width: 1260px;\n    height: 71px;\n    border-top: 3px solid #111;\n    font-size: 19px;\n  }\n\n  .footer-top {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 29px;\n    line-height: 27px;\n  }\n\n  .footer-code {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n  }\n\n  .footer-section {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 75px;\n    top: 0;\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n\n  .page-number {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 0;\n  }\n\n  .feedback {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 27px;\n    color: #0000ee;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n\n  .copyright {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 47px;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 17px;\n  }\n\n  @media print {\n    .page {\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"brand\" aria-label=\"Texas Instruments\">\n    <div class=\"brand-mark\"><span class=\"ti\">ti</span></div>\n    <div class=\"brand-name\">Texas<br>Instruments</div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"running-header\">\n    <span class=\"site\">www.ti.com</span>\n    <span class=\"section-name\">Multimedia Card Registers</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <main class=\"document-content\">\n    <h1 class=\"table-title\">Table 18-38. SD_STAT Register Field Descriptions (continued)</h1>\n\n    <table class=\"register-table\">\n      <colgroup>\n        <col class=\"bit\">\n        <col class=\"field\">\n        <col class=\"type\">\n        <col class=\"reset\">\n        <col class=\"description\">\n      </colgroup>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Bit</th>\n          <th>Field</th>\n          <th>Type</th>\n          <th>Reset</th>\n          <th>Description</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr class=\"row-cirq\">\n          <td class=\"bit-number\">8</td>\n          <td>CIRQ</td>\n          <td>R</td>\n          <td>0h</td>\n          <td class=\"description-cell\">Card interrupt.<br>\n            This bit is only used for SD and SDIO cards.<br>\n            In<br>\n            1-bit mode, interrupt source is asynchronous (can be a source of<br>\n            asynchronous wake-up).<br>\n            In<br>\n            4-bit mode, interrupt source is sampled during the interrupt cycle.<br>\n            In CE-ATA mode, interrupt source is detected when the card drives<br>\n            mmc_cmd line to zero during one cycle after data transmission end.<br>\n            All modes above are fully exclusive.<br>\n            The controller interrupt must be clear by setting SD_IE[8]<br>\n            CIRQ_ENABLE to 0, then the host driver must start the interrupt<br>\n            service with card (clearing card interrupt status) to remove card<br>\n            interrupt source.<br>\n            Otherwise the Controller interrupt will be reasserted as soon as<br>\n            SD_IE[8] CIRQ_ENABLE is set to 1.<br>\n            Writes to this bit are ignored.<br>\n            0h (R) = No card interrupt<br>\n            1h (R) = Generate card interrupt\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"row-crem\">\n          <td class=\"bit-number\">7</td>\n          <td>CREM</td>\n          <td>R/W</td>\n          <td>0h</td>\n          <td class=\"description-cell\">Card Removal.<br>\n            This bit is set automatically when SD_PSTATE[CINS] changes from<br>\n            1 to 0.<br>\n            A clear of this bit doesn't affect Card inserted present state<br>\n            (SD_PSTATE[CINS]).<br>\n            0h (W) = Status bit unchanged<br>\n            0h (R) = Card State stable or debouncing<br>\n            1h (W) = Status is cleared<br>\n            1h (R) = Card Removed\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"row-cins\">\n          <td class=\"bit-number\">6</td>\n          <td>CINS</td>\n          <td>R/W</td>\n          <td>0h</td>\n          <td class=\"description-cell\">Card Insertion.<br>\n            This bit is set automatically when SD_PSTATE[CINS] changes from<br>\n            0 to 1.<br>\n            A clear of this bit doesn't affect Card inserted present state<br>\n            (SD_PSTATE[CINS]).<br>\n            0h (W) = Status bit unchanged<br>\n            0h (R) = Card State stable or debouncing<br>\n            1h (W) = Status is cleared.<br>\n            1h (R) = Card inserted\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <tr class=\"row-brr\">\n          <td class=\"bit-number\">5</td>\n          <td>BRR</td>\n          <td>R/W</td>\n          <td>0h</td>\n          <td class=\"description-cell\">Buffer read ready.<br>\n            This bit is set automatically during a read operation to the card (see<br>\n            class<br>\n            2 - block oriented read commands) when one block specified by the<br>\n            SD_BLK<br>\n            [10:0] BLEN bit field is completely written in the buffer.<br>\n            It indicates that the memory card has filled out the buffer and that the<br>\n            local host needs to empty the buffer by reading it.<br>\n            Note: If the DMA receive-mode is enabled, this bit is never set<br>\n            instead a DMA receive request to the main DMA controller of the<br>\n            system is generated.<br>\n            0h (W) = Status bit unchanged<br>\n            0h (R) = Not ready to read buffer<br>\n            1h (W) = Status is cleared.<br>\n            1h (R) = Ready to read buffer\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"footer-top\">\n      <span class=\"footer-code\">SPRUH73O—October 2011—Revised December 2019</span>\n      <span class=\"footer-section\">Multimedia Card (MMC)</span>\n      <span class=\"page-number\">4299</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"feedback\">Submit Documentation Feedback</div>\n    <div class=\"copyright\">Copyright © 2011–2019, Texas Instruments Incorporated</div>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
